1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,107
Meet the McKinley Resident Assistant,

2
00:00:02,107 --> 00:00:06,720
an AI chat assistant that helps you take care
of your apartment, any time of day.

3
00:00:07,594 --> 00:00:11,391
When something breaks at home, getting it
fixed usually starts with a phone call.

4
00:00:11,671 --> 00:00:14,935
You call the office, wait on hold,
or leave a voicemail,

5
00:00:14,935 --> 00:00:19,073
and hope every detail gets written down.
After hours, it's even harder.

6
00:00:19,354 --> 00:00:22,643
The McKinley assistant replaces that
call with a short chat.

7
00:00:22,643 --> 00:00:25,000
You describe the problem in your own words,

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,631
and it builds a complete
repair request for you.

9
00:00:27,912 --> 00:00:30,320
It also helps people looking for a new home,

10
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:33,330
with questions about our
communities and tour requests.

11
00:00:34,214 --> 00:00:38,800
To start, open the assistant on your phone or
computer, and sign in to your account.

12
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:42,947
It greets you by name and offers
shortcuts for the most common tasks:

13
00:00:42,947 --> 00:00:47,656
report a repair, check your requests, ask about
your renewal, or talk to the office.

14
00:00:48,538 --> 00:00:51,205
You can tap a shortcut, or just
type what's going on,

15
00:00:51,205 --> 00:00:53,167
the way you'd explain it to a neighbor.

16
00:00:53,448 --> 00:00:54,472
Then press Send.

17
00:00:54,858 --> 00:00:58,958
If anything is missing, the assistant
asks a short follow-up question.

18
00:00:58,958 --> 00:01:02,004
Here, it needs to know which
room the problem is in.

19
00:01:02,284 --> 00:01:06,422
Under the reply, a progress note shows what's
still needed to finish the request.

20
00:01:06,701 --> 00:01:11,181
Marisol answers in one line, and adds that
maintenance may come in while she's out.

21
00:01:12,064 --> 00:01:16,691
Now the assistant shows a repair request
card, filled in from the conversation.

22
00:01:16,691 --> 00:01:18,976
Ready to send means nothing is missing.

23
00:01:19,256 --> 00:01:23,458
Read it row by row: what's wrong, where it is,
and whether maintenance may enter.

24
00:01:23,737 --> 00:01:26,718
It also adds useful history from your account.

25
00:01:26,718 --> 00:01:29,439
Here, an earlier AC request is still open,

26
00:01:29,439 --> 00:01:32,355
so the team can see this is a repeat problem.

27
00:01:32,636 --> 00:01:37,558
Nothing is sent until you say so. If a detail
is wrong, just type the correction,

28
00:01:37,558 --> 00:01:38,652
or tap Don't send.

29
00:01:39,533 --> 00:01:42,263
When everything looks right, tap
Send repair request.

30
00:01:42,544 --> 00:01:45,616
You get a reference number right away,
so you can mention it later.

31
00:01:45,895 --> 00:01:50,033
To see where it stands, tap Check its
status, or come back any time and ask.

32
00:01:50,314 --> 00:01:54,515
The reply lists every request on your
account, each with a clear status,

33
00:01:54,515 --> 00:01:56,266
like Follow-up owed, or Saved.

34
00:01:56,545 --> 00:01:59,531
If you'd rather speak with
someone, tap Talk to a person.

35
00:01:59,531 --> 00:02:03,460
The assistant prepares a note for the
office with what you've already said,

36
00:02:03,460 --> 00:02:05,398
so you don't have to repeat yourself.

37
00:02:05,677 --> 00:02:08,023
Tap Send note, and it's on
its way to the team.

38
00:02:08,906 --> 00:02:13,578
Some problems can't wait. If something is
dangerous, like a gas smell, just say so.

39
00:02:13,857 --> 00:02:17,922
The assistant puts safety first. It
tells you to leave right away,

40
00:02:17,922 --> 00:02:21,494
and to call 911 once you're
outside, before anything else.

41
00:02:21,775 --> 00:02:24,598
It also saves an urgent note for the team,

42
00:02:24,598 --> 00:02:27,556
but calling 911 yourself always comes first.

43
00:02:28,440 --> 00:02:31,559
On the McKinley side, requests
land in the staff queue,

44
00:02:31,559 --> 00:02:33,261
with urgent issues at the top.

45
00:02:33,542 --> 00:02:37,698
Each one shows the problem, the room, the
entry permission and the priority,

46
00:02:37,698 --> 00:02:40,432
so a team member can review it
and plan the visit.

47
00:02:40,712 --> 00:02:44,679
Good to know: the assistant isn't linked to
McKinley's maintenance system yet,

48
00:02:44,679 --> 00:02:48,392
so it can't book a visit time for you. A
team member takes it from there.

49
00:02:48,672 --> 00:02:52,575
So whenever something needs fixing, open
the chat, describe the problem,

50
00:02:52,575 --> 00:02:55,285
check your request, and send.
Thanks for watching.

